Gravitational-wave strain data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
js/data/gw/**
Derived from data released by the Gravitational Wave Open Science Center,
licensed CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

  This research has made use of data or software obtained from the
  Gravitational Wave Open Science Center (gwosc.org), a service of the LIGO
  Scientific Collaboration, the Virgo Collaboration, and KAGRA.

The bundled traces are decimated subsets of the published band-passed strain.
Every processing step, the source URL and a checksum are recorded in the data
files themselves, and `npm run gw:provenance` regenerates them from the
originals and compares byte for byte.

Primary reference: Abbott et al. (2016), Phys. Rev. Lett. 116, 061102,
doi:10.1103/PhysRevLett.116.061102

